# Agreement Commencement and Consultation Requirements

This scope computes the provisional start date of the agreement and the required minimum consultation period before implementing export duties.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementCommencement:
  input date_wto_accession content date
  input implementation_date content date
  output provisional_start_date content date
  output consultation_start_date content date
```

## Provisional Application

The agreement shall be applied provisionally from the date of the Russian Federation’s accession to the WTO.

```catala
scope AgreementCommencement:
  date round down
  definition provisional_start_date equals date_wto_accession
```

## Consultation Requirement

If export duties are considered, consultations must begin at least two months prior to the implementation date.

```catala
scope AgreementCommencement:
  definition consultation_start_date equals implementation_date - 2 month
```